// Hexgrind rounds — cursed ammunition that bites deeper: adds penetration (the weapon's
// WeaponPunch), so the shot ignores more armour. GTW-549 data-driven attachment ITEM (the
// grimdark "HexgrindRounds" tag, now an item). Magnitude lives HERE on the item. Referenced
// by a weapon BY KEY in its `attachments:` list; applied to the weapon post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Hexgrind Rounds",
    // GTW-584: re-slotted Rail -> Magazine. The name/fiction read as ammunition ("rounds", a
    // cursed-ammo feed), so this loaded-ammunition item belongs in the magazine well, not on
    // the general utility rail where GTW-554 parked it for lack of a Magazine slot. (This is
    // the MOUNT point for an ammo feed, distinct from GTW-775's AmmoType `accepts:` gate.)
    slot: Magazine,
    effects: [
        Penetration(6),  // +6 to the weapon's punch (armour ignored) — tunable
    ],
)
